---
description: Twig integration and public assets
globs:
  - "src/Twig/**/*.php"
  - "demo/*/templates/**/*.twig"
alwaysApply: false
---

This bundle ships no Twig templates and no public assets: it only exposes the Twig functions
`wallet_qr_data_uri()` and `wallet_qr_for_url()` from `src/Twig/WalletQrExtension.php`.
Templates live in the host application (and in `demo/*/templates` for the demos).

Prefer:
- small, backward-compatible changes to the Twig function names and signatures
- returning data (URLs, data URIs, value objects) and letting Twig auto-escape the HTML context
- keeping `wallet_qr_for_url()` behind the nowo_qr_code URL policy / allowlist

Do not mark untrusted strings as `is_safe`.
Do not add templates or `src/Resources/public` assets without updating README, docs and these rules.
